    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<iframe allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tn1OSsKsj50\" width=\"560\"></iframe><br /></div>\n<br />\n▍蠓仔香kap蠓仔<br />\n作者：&nbsp;黃桂蘭<br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">伊甸園</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">警告，早就</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">bē</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">記</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">--ah <o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">無法度阻擋迷惑</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"> <span lang=\"EN\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">偷偷仔鼻你身軀</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">芳味</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , serif;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">飛過巴別塔是我一生</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">夢</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"> <span lang=\"EN\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">使弄親</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">tsiânn</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">五十做伙來</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"> <span lang=\"EN\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">Tī</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">頂面飛來飛去</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"> <span lang=\"EN\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-T