-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">我</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">意志愈來愈強</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"> <span lang=\"EN\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">明知仔</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"> <span lang=\"EN\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">留戀是一條無回頭</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">路</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">硫磺噴</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">出</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">煙霧是一座</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\">hàm</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;pmingliu&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: PMingLiU;